---@field account_id string
---@field query_id cloudflare.brand_protection.V2MatchesGetRequestQueryIdList ID of a domain query, or a comma-separated list of domain query IDs. When you pass several IDs, matches are deduplicated by domain and each match includes a `match_details` array with per-query metadata and dismissed state.
