---@field limit? string Maximum number of matches to return. Defaults to 50.
---@field offset? string Number of matches to skip, for pagination. Defaults to 0.
---@field order? cloudflare.brand_protection.V2MatchesGetRequestOrder|string Sort direction: `asc` or `desc`. Defaults to `desc`. For single-query requests, `asc` applies only when `orderBy` is set.
